Package: MQR
Title: Joint Time-Varying Quantile Regressions with Multi-Outcome Latent Groups
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tianying", "Wang", email = "tianying.wang@colostate.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yanyuan", "Ma", role = "aut"),
    person("Ying", "Wei", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements a novel quantile regression framework for investigating
    time-dependent covariate effects on multiple outcomes, where different outcome
    variables may share common covariate effects. The method simultaneously identifies
    latent group structures and estimates covariate effects without the need to model
    the multivariate distribution of the response vector. Features include B-spline
    approximation for time-varying coefficients, iterative optimization for joint
    estimation of group membership and coefficients, and information criterion-based
    model selection.
